[
  {
    "key": "computer:screenshot",
    "name": "computer:screenshot",
    "category": "computer-control",
    "role": "inspect",
    "permissions": [
      "screen:capture"
    ],
    "requiredModelInputModalities": [
      "image"
    ],
    "description": "描述：截取桌面主屏幕，用于定位原生应用 UI。\n\n适合：\n- 执行桌面点击/输入前确认界面并获取坐标。\n\n禁止：\n- 网页内容用 browser 工具，不要用桌面截图替代。\n\n用法：\n- 无需参数；返回的 snapshotId 要原样传给随后基于该截图坐标执行的 computer:move 与 computer:click。\n\n示例：\n- 调用参数示例：{}。\n\n注意：\n- 返回屏幕几何与 snapshotId，截图本身作为图片交给你。\n- 截图为主显示器局部逻辑坐标；图上量出的像素可直接用于 computer:move、computer:click，同时必须携带本次返回的 snapshotId。\n- 动作执行前 helper 会校验 snapshotId 和当前主屏布局；主屏切换、分辨率、缩放或原点变化时会拒绝旧坐标并要求重新截图。",
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "properties": {},
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  {
    "key": "computer:move",
    "name": "computer:move",
    "category": "computer-control",
    "role": "control",
    "permissions": [
      "input:control"
    ],
    "requiredModelInputModalities": null,
    "description": "描述：移动鼠标到屏幕坐标（不点击）。\n\n适合：\n- 需要悬停某处但不点击。\n\n禁止：\n- 点击用 computer:click；不要省略或复用其他截图的 snapshotId。\n\n用法：\n- 移动到截图内位置：传 x、y 和同一次 computer:screenshot 返回的 snapshotId。\n- 显式全局坐标传 coordinateSpace=global，且不要传 snapshotId。\n\n示例：\n- 调用参数示例：{\"x\":640,\"y\":400,\"snapshotId\":\"screen_example_snapshot_01\"}。\n\n注意：\n- helper 会在真实移动前校验截图绑定；主屏或布局变化后旧 snapshotId 会被拒绝，请重新截图。",
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "coordinateSpace": {
              "const": "primary-display",
              "default": "primary-display",
              "description": "描述：默认 primary-display：坐标相对 computer:screenshot 左上角。",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "snapshotId": {
              "description": "描述：computer:screenshot 返回的不透明 snapshotId；必须原样传回。",
              "maxLength": 128,
              "minLength": 8,
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "x": {
              "description": "描述：主屏截图内的逻辑 x 坐标。",
              "maximum": 20000,
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "y": {
              "description": "描述：主屏截图内的逻辑 y 坐标。",
              "maximum": 20000,
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "x",
            "y",
            "snapshotId"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "coordinateSpace": {
              "const": "global",
              "description": "描述：显式全局虚拟桌面坐标。",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "x": {
              "description": "描述：虚拟桌面的全局逻辑 x 坐标，可为负数。",
              "maximum": 20000,
              "minimum": -20000,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "y": {
              "description": "描述：虚拟桌面的全局逻辑 y 坐标，可为负数。",
              "maximum": 20000,
              "minimum": -20000,
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "x",
            "y",
            "coordinateSpace"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "key": "computer:click",
    "name": "computer:click",
    "category": "computer-control",
    "role": "control",
    "permissions": [
      "input:control"
    ],
    "requiredModelInputModalities": null,
    "description": "描述：在屏幕坐标点击桌面或原生应用。\n\n适合：\n- 点击桌面按钮、菜单、输入框等元素。\n\n禁止：\n- 网页内点击用 browser 工具；不要省略或复用其他截图的 snapshotId。\n\n用法：\n- 点击截图内位置：传 x、y 和同一次 computer:screenshot 返回的 snapshotId。\n- 可选 button 和 count（双击传 2）；显式全局坐标传 coordinateSpace=global，且不要传 snapshotId。\n\n示例：\n- 调用参数示例：{\"x\":756,\"y\":342,\"snapshotId\":\"screen_example_snapshot_01\"}。\n\n注意：\n- helper 会在真实点击前校验截图绑定；主屏或布局变化后旧 snapshotId 会被拒绝，请重新截图。",
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "button": {
              "description": "描述：鼠标按键，默认 left。",
              "enum": [
                "left",
                "right",
                "middle"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            "coordinateSpace": {
              "const": "primary-display",
              "default": "primary-display",
              "description": "描述：默认 primary-display：坐标相对 computer:screenshot 左上角。",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "count": {
              "description": "描述：点击次数，双击传 2。默认 1。",
              "maximum": 3,
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "snapshotId": {
              "description": "描述：computer:screenshot 返回的不透明 snapshotId；必须原样传回。",
              "maxLength": 128,
              "minLength": 8,
              "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]+$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "x": {
              "description": "描述：主屏截图内的逻辑 x 坐标。",
              "maximum": 20000,
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "y": {
              "description": "描述：主屏截图内的逻辑 y 坐标。",
              "maximum": 20000,
              "minimum": 0,
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "x",
            "y",
            "snapshotId"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "properties": {
            "button": {
              "description": "描述：鼠标按键，默认 left。",
              "enum": [
                "left",
                "right",
                "middle"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            "coordinateSpace": {
              "const": "global",
              "description": "描述：显式全局虚拟桌面坐标。",
              "type": "string"
            },
            "count": {
              "description": "描述：点击次数，双击传 2。默认 1。",
              "maximum": 3,
              "minimum": 1,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "x": {
              "description": "描述：虚拟桌面的全局逻辑 x 坐标，可为负数。",
              "maximum": 20000,
              "minimum": -20000,
              "type": "integer"
            },
            "y": {
              "description": "描述：虚拟桌面的全局逻辑 y 坐标，可为负数。",
              "maximum": 20000,
              "minimum": -20000,
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          "required": [
            "x",
            "y",
            "coordinateSpace"
          ],
          "type": "object"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
    "key": "computer:type",
    "name": "computer:type",
    "category": "computer-control",
    "role": "control",
    "permissions": [
      "input:control"
    ],
    "requiredModelInputModalities": null,
    "description": "描述：在当前焦点处输入文本。\n\n适合：\n- 向已聚焦的输入框/编辑器输入文字。\n\n禁止：\n- 组合键用 computer:key。\n\n用法：\n- 先点击获取焦点，再传 text。\n\n示例：\n- 调用参数示例：{\"text\":\"hello world\"}。",
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "properties": {
        "text": {
          "description": "描述：要输入的文本。",
          "maxLength": 10000,
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "text"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  {
    "key": "computer:key",
    "name": "computer:key",
    "category": "computer-control",
    "role": "control",
    "permissions": [
      "input:control"
    ],
    "requiredModelInputModalities": null,
    "description": "描述：按下按键或组合键。\n\n适合：\n- 发送 Enter、Esc、Tab 或 cmd/ctrl 快捷键。\n\n禁止：\n- 普通文本用 computer:type。\n\n用法：\n- 传按键序列，用 + 连接。\n\n示例：\n- 调用参数示例：{\"keys\":\"enter\"}。\n- 调用参数示例：{\"keys\":\"cmd+a\"}。",
    "schema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
      "properties": {
        "keys": {
          "description": "描述：按键序列，组合键用 + 连接。\n\n用法：\n- 示例：enter、esc、tab、cmd+a、ctrl+c。",
          "maxLength": 100,
          "minLength": 1,
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "keys"
      ],
      "type": "object"
    }
  }
]
